{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789175885878,"sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"glob","callID":"call_qCe2ZcOQzl10tWvrdbKUykUq","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"*"},"output":"/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/services/project-service.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/services/organization-service.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/routes/organizations.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/routes/projects.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/routes/account.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/db/membership-repository.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/db/database.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/db/project-repository.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/http/list-options.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/http/response.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/http/router.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/types.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/seed.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/app.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/auth/session.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/auth/membership.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/cache/project-cache.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/cache/keys.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/package.json\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/package-lock.json\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/.gitignore\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/README.md\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/tests/account.test.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/tests/projects.test.ts\n/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/.handwork/settings.json","metadata":{"count":25,"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1789175885856,"end":1789175885876}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c104770323ab5e3016aa4a84dbc8887d19ffb27bc8fd3b474"}},"id":"prt_09331701c001UyUFjEztrAVchC","sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","messageID":"msg_093315ceb001EPwImZD7yrqvYA"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789175885893,"sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_dC1BcwM9mwL5eMdm579W3bQX","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git status --short"},"output":"(no output)","metadata":{"output":"(no output)","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"git status --short","time":{"start":1789175885874,"end":1789175885892}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c104770323ab5e3016aa4a84dbc8087d1b593f29254e9368b"}},"id":"prt_09331701a001OCuhOrI7rc5Nx3","sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","messageID":"msg_093315ceb001EPwImZD7yrqvYA"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789175959797,"sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_mIce9mwmSovgI4LhTwZcXhl1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Trace project isolation paths","subagent_type":"explore","prompt":"Inspect repository for project read/update/list authorization and caching bugs. Identify relevant files, exact root causes, minimal fixes and existing test commands. Research only, do not edit. Thoroughness medium."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f6cce8feeffe47RMqodL5HZKUb\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Findings\n\nFound **three root causes** affecting project reads, updates, and cached lists. No files were edited. The existing test suite passes but does not cover these failures.\n\n### 1. Project detail and update omit ownership authorization\n**Severity: High — cross-organization reads and writes**\n\n**Location:** [src/services/project-service.ts:10–13,24–28](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/services/project-service.ts#L10)\n\n- `detail(userId, projectId)` looks up the project and checks only whether it exists; `userId` is unused.\n- `update()` calls `detail()` as its authorization gate, so it also lacks a membership check.\n- Routes require a valid session, but authentication alone does not establish access to the owning organization.\n\n**Concrete failure:** In the supplied seed, Bob belongs only to `org-b`, yet can read or rename project `a1`, owned by `org-a`. Revoking membership likewise does not prevent detail reads or updates.\n\n**Minimal fix:**\n1. Keep the missing-project `404` check.\n2. Before returning the project, call:\n   ```ts\n   requireMembership(db, userId, project.organizationId);\n   ```\n3. Continue using this authorized detail lookup in `update()`, before body validation, storage mutation, or cache invalidation.\n\nUse the stored project’s organization—not query/body ownership fields. The repository already limits updates to `name`, so ownership reassignment is not currently possible.\n\n### 2. List cache keys omit the organization\n**Severity: High — cross-organization data leakage**\n\n**Location:** [src/cache/keys.ts:2–3](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/cache/keys.ts#L2)  \n**Consumer:** [src/services/project-service.ts:17–22](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/services/project-service.ts#L17)\n\n`projectListKey(organizationId, options)` accepts `organizationId` but ignores it. Organizations with identical pagination and sort options share a cache entry.\n\n**Concrete failure:**\n1. Alice lists `org-a`, warming the default-options cache.\n2. Bob lists `org-b`.\n3. Bob passes membership validation for `org-b` but receives `org-a`’s cached projects.\n\n**Minimal fix:** Include an unambiguously encoded organization identifier while preserving all four list options. For example:\n```ts\n`projects:list:${JSON.stringify(organizationId)}:${options.page}:${options.pageSize}:${options.sort}:${options.direction}`\n```\n\nUse a shared organization-prefix helper for both key creation and invalidation. Including the complete JSON-encoded ID plus its delimiter avoids collisions between IDs sharing prefixes or containing punctuation.\n\n**Preserve:** `list()` currently checks live membership **before** consulting the cache. That ordering is correct and must remain.\n\n### 3. Successful updates leave every cached list stale\n**Severity: Medium — stale content, ordering, and pagination**\n\n**Location:** [src/services/project-service.ts:24–29](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/services/project-service.ts#L24)  \n**Snapshot behavior:** [src/cache/project-cache.ts:12–14](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/src/cache/project-cache.ts#L12)\n\nAfter updating a project, the service deletes only `projectDetailKey(projectId)`. Detail reads never populate that cache key, so this deletion currently accomplishes nothing. Cached lists contain cloned snapshots and remain stale indefinitely.\n\n**Concrete failure:** List `org-a`, rename `a1`, then repeat the list: the cached result retains its old name and timestamp. Changes also affect sorting and page boundaries, so refreshing only the page containing that project would be insufficient.\n\n**Minimal fix:**\n- Retain the authorized project returned by `detail()` to obtain its owning organization.\n- After a successful repository update, iterate `cache.keys()` and delete **every list variant for exactly that organization**, using the safely encoded prefix from finding 2.\n- Preserve unrelated organizations’ cached lists.\n- Do not invalidate anything for forbidden requests or invalid bodies.\n- Continue using only the injected cache’s `get/set/delete/keys` interface; do not disable caching or clear it globally.\n\n## Existing tests and commands\n\n**Configuration:** [package.json:5–9](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/package.json#L5)  \n**Documented requirements:** [README.md:9–21](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/README.md#L9)\n\nRequires **Node 24+**, with no third-party dependencies:\n\n```sh\nnpm test\n# Equivalent:\nnode --test tests/*.test.ts\n\n# Project tests only:\nnode --test tests/projects.test.ts\n```\n\n**Executed:** `npm test` on Node `v24.21.0`: **8 passed, 0 failed**.\n\nExisting coverage:\n- [tests/projects.test.ts](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/tests/projects.test.ts): authorized detail/list/update, anonymous detail rejection, invalid name.\n- [tests/account.test.ts](/private/tmp/handwork-tenant-benchmark-4znq2rjy/3-3-opencode/repo/tests/account.test.ts): health/profile, organization scoping, logout.\n\n### Recommended regression coverage\n- Nonmember GET/PATCH returns `403` with no resource fields, storage changes, or cache changes.\n- Spoofed organization IDs in query/body cannot authorize access.\n- Revoked membership blocks detail, update, and already-cached lists immediately.\n- Identical list options across organizations never share results.\n- Repeated authorized identical lists avoid another repository list query.\n- Updates invalidate all owning-organization pagination/sort variants, preserve other organizations’ cache hits, and work with prefix-sharing/punctuated organization IDs.\n- Missing projects remain `404`; invalid updates leave storage and cache unchanged.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","sessionId":"ses_f6cce8feeffe47RMqodL5HZKUb","model":{"modelID":"gpt-6-astra","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Trace project isolation paths","time":{"start":1789175885843,"end":1789175959794}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c104770323ab5e3016aa4a84dbc6c87d1b69dfc226152b569"}},"id":"prt_093316fe40019ExeM0Y1a5gbLp","sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","messageID":"msg_093315ceb001EPwImZD7yrqvYA"}}
