{"type":"text","timestamp":1789176073065,"sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","part":{"id":"prt_09334231a001EvvS2bxosNOH8x","messageID":"msg_0933411bf0013OAEXzGKmEl4ZF","sessionID":"ses_f6ccebb5dffej1yBvOjg8rAq7i","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes.\n\n- **Authorization:** Project reads and updates now require membership in the project’s stored owning organization. Unauthorized requests return `403` without returning project data or changing storage.\n- **Cache isolation:** List keys now include an unambiguously encoded organization ID while retaining `page`, `pageSize`, `sort`, and `direction`.\n- **Invalidation:** Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for the owning organization, leaving unrelated organizations’ cached lists usable.\n- **Cached authorization:** List membership checks remain before cache lookup, so revoked membership immediately blocks access to cached results.\n\nExisting API signatures, response shapes, and status-code conventions are unchanged. Caching remains enabled.\n\n**Verification**\nAdded four regression tests covering cross-organization access, organization switching, revoked membership, all pagination/sorting variants, targeted invalidation, and rejected-request side effects.\n\n- `npm test`: **12 passed, 0 failed**, including all 8 existing tests.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Existing tests were not modified; no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789176062746,"end":1789176073064},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_098d9c80c4d77a41016aa4a8feb42087d18abfee5eee72f419","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
